---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  description="Credits and acknowledgments for the open-source software, assets, and tools used by FryrvoStudio."
  title="Credits · Fryrvo"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="sm:pb:20 flex flex-col gap-4 pb-16 text-center">
      <img
        class="h-[150px] w-[250px] mx-auto rounded-3xl object-contain"
        src="https://cdn.fryrvo.com/assets/fryrvo/Logo_bg.png"
        alt="icon"
      />
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Credits & Attributions</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-400">Last update: 12 September 2026</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-gray-300">
      <p class="mb-4">
        this project is built with the help of amazing opensource, design resources, themes, and community projects.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 text-xl font-medium text-white sm:text-2xl">Credits</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-3">
        <li>
          <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Astro</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/m6v3l9/astro-theme-stone" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Astro Theme Stone</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/kydecker/astro-photo-grid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Astro Photo Grid</a>
        </li>

        <li>
          <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Tailwind CSS</a> & <a href="https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/main/packages/integrations/tailwind" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">@astrojs/tailwind</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://alpinejs.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Alpine.js</a> & <a href="https://github.com/alpinejs/alpine/tree/main/packages/collapse" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">@alpinejs/collapse</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://fancyapps.com/fancybox" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Fancybox UI (@fancyapps/ui)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://fontsource.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Fontsource Inter (@fontsource/inter)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/main/packages/integrations/sitemap" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Astro Sitemap (@astrojs/sitemap)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/alextim/astro-compress" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Astro Compress</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Cloudflare Pages & R2</a>
        </li>
       
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">TypeScript</a> & <a href="https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/main/packages/check" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">@astrojs/check</a>
        </li>
        
        <li>
          <a href="https://prettier.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">Prettier</a>, <a href="https://github.com/withastro/prettier-plugin-astro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">prettier-plugin-astro</a>, & <a href="https://github.com/tailwindlabs/prettier-plugin-tailwindcss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200 font-medium">prettier-plugin-tailwindcss</a>
        </li>
       
        <li>
          <span class="text-white font-medium">Smartypants</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
       <br>
       </be>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
        And all open-source projects out there.
      </p>


<h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 text-xl font-medium text-white sm:text-2xl">Licensing</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Source Code Repository:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/Fryrvo/Site" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200">github.com/Fryrvo/fryrvo-site</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Code License:</strong> The source code of this website is licensed under the <a href="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200">MIT License</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Assets & Media Copyright:</strong> All assets are Copyright © <a href="https://fryrvo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white underline hover:text-gray-200">Fryrvo</a>. 2026. All rights reserved.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 text-xl font-medium text-white sm:text-2xl">Thank You</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We are grateful to be a part of the open-source community. and make everythings possible.
        <br>
        Thank You All! for giving me everything without asking anything =)
        <br>
        Thank for Teaching me everything
        <br>
        <br>
        Cath, Fryrvo
      </p>
   
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>